	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0601_girl1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きんようびに　なるたびにね
どこからか　ポケモンが　くるの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:25:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:57:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>金曜日に　なるたびにね
どこからか　ポケモンが　来るの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:25:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:57:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ワシボンのヒント</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T08:02:39" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:26:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0601_assistantm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンが　かいほう　されて
しんの　ちからを　はっきしたら……▼
いつか　われわれは　ポケモンに
つかわれて　たたかうのでは　ないか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:28:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:57:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンが　解放されて
真の　力を　発揮したら……▼
いつか　われわれは　ポケモンに
使われて　戦うのでは　ないか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:28:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T07:57:54" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:28:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ASSISTANTM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-12T09:26:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0601_trainerw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしね　ポケモンの
