				Time="2011-07-26T06:58:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくはね　ポケモンの
攻撃に　こだわってるね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T03:51:52" />
