	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r04r0601_trainerm_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そういうわけで　きみ！▼
[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]より　こうげきが　たかい
ポケモンを　つれていないかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T08:11:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T06:58:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そういうわけで　きみ！▼
[Digit:3digits Idx="1" ]より　攻撃が　高い
ポケモンを　連れていないかな？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-05T08:11:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T06:58:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・White2ver
・手持ち（ひんし/タマゴを除く）をサーチ
・？？？以上のポケモンが
　いる　→trainerm_03、trainerm_04
　いない→trainerm_06
・0＝３桁の数字（050～200からランダムで決定）（仮）
・数字は一日中固定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:56:28" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T07:55:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
